WEBVTT

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:06.439
The prophets sing.
This is a holy time.

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:10.704
B'tanay, the time of awakening.

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:19.050
Return to that dark place
from which all life springs.

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:21.952
A primal energy
charges your blood,

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:23.750
an energy of rebirth.

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:29.261
The mind awakens
and focuses on its task.

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:34.961
Pagh 'tem 'far B'tanay.

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:37.629
Pagh 'tem 'far

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:39.501
B'tanay.

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:35.719
Fresh flowers?

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:37.756
An afternoon on the holodeck?

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:40.554
It almost feels
like we're dating again.

00:02:40.627 --> 00:02:42.117
The secret to a
lasting marriage...

00:02:42.195 --> 00:02:43.287
keep the romance alive.

00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:45.092
I'm not complaining.

00:02:47.967 --> 00:02:48.934
Lecture hall?

00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:49.969
Guess again.

00:02:50.036 --> 00:02:53.062
Opera house?

00:02:53.139 --> 00:02:55.437
Not another one of the
Doctor's performances?

00:02:55.508 --> 00:02:57.066
This is a movie house.

00:02:57.143 --> 00:03:01.773
This is the old Palace Theater
in Chicago, built in 1932.

00:03:01.848 --> 00:03:04.749
Look at the detail
on that crown molding.

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:07.047
It doesn't look
very functional.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.452
Well, this place
isn't about function.

00:03:09.522 --> 00:03:11.547
It's about fantasy.

00:03:16.029 --> 00:03:18.293
Chewing gum.

00:03:18.364 --> 00:03:22.130
There is such a thing
as too much authenticity.

00:03:22.202 --> 00:03:23.601
Attention to detail.

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:25.297
That's what makes it fun.

00:03:27.507 --> 00:03:29.304
Protective lenses?

00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:31.605
These will make the
images on the screen

00:03:31.678 --> 00:03:33.305
appear three-dimensional.

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.938
Let me get this straight.

00:03:36.015 --> 00:03:37.482
You've gone
to all this trouble

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:39.541
to program a three-dimensional
environment

00:03:39.619 --> 00:03:41.348
that projects
a two-dimensional image,

00:03:41.421 --> 00:03:43.184
and now you're asking me
to wear these

00:03:43.256 --> 00:03:45.156
to make it look
three-dimensional again?

00:03:45.225 --> 00:03:46.658
Great, isn't it?

00:04:15.955 --> 00:04:17.786
Crick in your neck?

00:04:17.857 --> 00:04:19.518
People didn't go to the movies

00:04:19.592 --> 00:04:21.287
just for the movies, you know.

00:04:21.361 --> 00:04:23.693
Really? What did they go for?

00:04:23.763 --> 00:04:26.561
Well, I'll try to demonstrate.

00:04:33.273 --> 00:04:36.208
I can see why this
was so popular.

00:04:36.276 --> 00:04:37.208
Shh!

00:04:41.381 --> 00:04:44.179
Maybe this would be more fun
if we were alone.

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.514
Computer, delete audience.

00:04:51.424 --> 00:04:53.858
Who's in the front row?

00:04:53.926 --> 00:04:55.052
Must be a glitch.

00:04:55.128 --> 00:04:58.928
No. That's Tabor.

00:04:58.998 --> 00:05:00.329
This is an emergency.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:01.890
The gill-man has escaped.

00:05:01.968 --> 00:05:04.766
Please, please clear
the ocean area.

00:05:04.837 --> 00:05:06.395
Get out, everybody.

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:09.931
Are you okay?

00:05:15.448 --> 00:05:17.541
He appears to be in a coma,

00:05:17.617 --> 00:05:20.916
but I'm reading
unusual synaptic activity.

00:05:21.054 --> 00:05:23.386
- What happened to him?
- I don't know.

00:05:23.456 --> 00:05:25.617
I'd like to know what he's been
doing the last few weeks...

00:05:25.692 --> 00:05:28.058
where he's worked,
away missions...

00:05:28.127 --> 00:05:30.152
I'll access his duty roster.

00:05:33.066 --> 00:05:35.830
Was Ensign Tabor wearing these
when he was found?

00:05:35.902 --> 00:05:37.426
No, they were on the floor
next to him.

00:05:37.503 --> 00:05:40.028
I don't think
they cause comas.

00:05:40.106 --> 00:05:42.597
Lights strobing
at certain frequencies

00:05:42.675 --> 00:05:44.609
have been known
to induce seizures.

00:05:44.677 --> 00:05:48.113
We should analyze the optical
properties of this "movie."

00:05:48.181 --> 00:05:50.741
When was the last time
you spoke with Mr. Tabor?

00:05:50.817 --> 00:05:52.216
About 10, 15 minutes

00:05:52.285 --> 00:05:54.446
before B'Elanna and I got here.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:55.487
He called to say

00:05:55.555 --> 00:05:57.489
the program was up and running.

00:05:57.557 --> 00:05:59.115
Funny...

00:05:59.192 --> 00:06:00.887
Lieutenant?

00:06:02.795 --> 00:06:04.387
When we were
in the Maquis together,

00:06:04.464 --> 00:06:06.056
we used to joke
that Tabor must have had

00:06:06.132 --> 00:06:07.895
his own personal force field.

00:06:07.967 --> 00:06:09.229
He went through
a dozen firefights

00:06:09.302 --> 00:06:11.327
without even getting
his clothes dirty.

00:06:11.404 --> 00:06:12.894
He's still alive.

00:06:13.005 --> 00:06:15.496
Perhaps his force field
is holding.

00:06:15.575 --> 00:06:18.408
Commander, I've reviewed
the sensor logs

00:06:18.478 --> 00:06:20.070
for the four hours
Tabor was here.

00:06:20.146 --> 00:06:21.738
All systems were
operating normally.

00:06:21.814 --> 00:06:23.213
Safeties were on-line.

00:06:23.282 --> 00:06:26.376
Run a level-5 diagnostic
on the logs.

00:06:26.452 --> 00:06:27.783
Janeway to Tuvok.

00:06:27.854 --> 00:06:29.583
Report to Sick Bay.

00:06:29.655 --> 00:06:30.883
On my way.

00:06:30.957 --> 00:06:33.152
I've found several
microfractures

00:06:33.226 --> 00:06:34.352
in his cranium.

00:06:34.427 --> 00:06:36.395
They're minor,
but the pattern suggests

00:06:36.462 --> 00:06:38.487
that he suffered
a trauma of some sort.

00:06:38.564 --> 00:06:40.930
There's also evidence
of subdermal contusions

00:06:41.067 --> 00:06:42.432
along his right shoulder.

00:06:42.502 --> 00:06:43.696
This man was attacked.

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:45.260
It's possible
that whoever did it

00:06:45.338 --> 00:06:46.270
is still on board.

00:06:46.339 --> 00:06:47.863
Go to Yellow Alert.

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:49.874
Tuvok, I'm putting you in charge

00:06:49.942 --> 00:06:50.931
of the investigation.

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:52.375
Aye, Captain.

00:07:00.586 --> 00:07:04.022
Security override:
Tuvok-pi-Alpha.

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:09.589
Commander.

00:07:09.662 --> 00:07:12.722
Crewman Jor,
if I'm not mistaken,

00:07:12.799 --> 00:07:14.357
your quarters are on Deck 4.

00:07:14.434 --> 00:07:15.901
I heard what happened to Tabor.

00:07:16.002 --> 00:07:17.993
I was looking for a book
to bring to him.

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:20.903
I'm afraid
he's in no condition to read.

00:07:21.007 --> 00:07:22.372
I was going to read to him.

00:07:22.442 --> 00:07:25.309
I've heard sometimes it helps
to hear a familiar voice.

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:29.205
You and Tabor were friends.

00:07:29.282 --> 00:07:30.306
Do you have any idea

00:07:30.383 --> 00:07:31.907
why someone would want
to hurt him?

00:07:31.984 --> 00:07:34.680
I can't imagine.

00:07:34.754 --> 00:07:36.016
Could you tell me

00:07:36.088 --> 00:07:39.057
where you were
from 0700 to 1100 hours

00:07:39.125 --> 00:07:40.251
this morning?

00:07:40.326 --> 00:07:42.920
On duty... in Engineering.

00:07:43.029 --> 00:07:45.122
You can check
with Lieutenant Torres

00:07:45.198 --> 00:07:47.598
if you'd like.

00:07:47.667 --> 00:07:49.225
That won't be necessary.

00:07:49.302 --> 00:07:50.326
Thank you, Crewman.

00:07:59.145 --> 00:08:00.305
Harry's found evidence

00:08:00.379 --> 00:08:03.246
that someone tampered
with the holodeck sensor logs.

00:08:03.316 --> 00:08:05.011
Several files
have been deleted.

00:08:05.084 --> 00:08:06.847
Any sign of an outside intruder?

00:08:06.919 --> 00:08:08.216
No, nothing.

00:08:08.287 --> 00:08:12.383
I believe that a member of
this crew is responsible.

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:15.693
Tabor was well-liked.

00:08:15.761 --> 00:08:17.058
What's the motive?

00:08:18.097 --> 00:08:19.860
I have one suspect.

00:08:19.932 --> 00:08:21.297
Crewman Jor.

00:08:21.367 --> 00:08:23.232
I find that hard to believe.

00:08:23.302 --> 00:08:25.429
I've known her for a long time.

00:08:25.505 --> 00:08:27.336
She and Tabor were friends.

00:08:27.406 --> 00:08:28.430
Close friends.

00:08:28.508 --> 00:08:29.475
She had access

00:08:29.542 --> 00:08:31.032
to his quarters.

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:32.873
A close relationship
is hardly a crime.

00:08:32.945 --> 00:08:35.607
It is my experience
that emotional involvements

00:08:35.681 --> 00:08:37.774
often lead
to unpredictable behavior.

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:40.910
That's an opinion...
not evidence.

00:08:41.053 --> 00:08:43.146
There may be other suspects.

00:08:43.222 --> 00:08:45.053
I intend to question
all crew members

00:08:45.124 --> 00:08:46.887
who had recent contact
with Tabor.

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:52.119
I'll check the internal sensors,
see what else I can find.

00:08:57.069 --> 00:08:58.263
Commander.

00:09:02.508 --> 00:09:06.205
You seem awfully convinced that
one of the crew was behind this.

00:09:06.279 --> 00:09:08.839
Now, you can't tell me that's
the only logical conclusion,

00:09:08.915 --> 00:09:11.110
because I can think
of a number of others.

00:09:12.652 --> 00:09:16.679
I realize my assumptions
seem premature...

00:09:16.756 --> 00:09:19.884
but I have a strong instinct
about this.

00:09:19.992 --> 00:09:22.119
You might call it a hunch.

00:09:22.194 --> 00:09:24.594
I didn't think
Vulcans had hunches.

00:09:25.965 --> 00:09:30.265
I can't explain it, Captain,
but I can't ignore it, either.

00:09:30.336 --> 00:09:32.770
Someone on board is responsible,

00:09:32.838 --> 00:09:35.466
and I intend to find out
who it is.

00:09:42.481 --> 00:09:44.711
Pressure is fluctuating
in 114.

00:09:44.784 --> 00:09:46.376
You'd better check the seals.

00:10:13.379 --> 00:10:15.347
Yosa to Engineering.

00:10:17.383 --> 00:10:20.181
Engineering?

00:10:26.192 --> 00:10:27.557
Hello?

00:10:43.576 --> 00:10:45.976
Computer, seal hatch 613-Beta.

00:10:46.045 --> 00:10:48.036
Unable to comply.

00:10:52.485 --> 00:10:54.112
Crewman Yosa to Security.

00:11:00.393 --> 00:11:03.556
His neocortical readings
are identical to Tabor's,

00:11:03.629 --> 00:11:05.494
and he has
the same microfractures

00:11:05.564 --> 00:11:07.395
along his right temple.

00:11:07.466 --> 00:11:08.797
Who discovered him?

00:11:08.868 --> 00:11:10.301
Crewman Jor.

00:11:10.369 --> 00:11:14.100
Chakotay to Crewman Jor.

00:11:14.173 --> 00:11:15.936
Jor, respond.

00:11:16.075 --> 00:11:17.804
Computer, locate Crewman Jor.

00:11:17.877 --> 00:11:20.869
Crewman Jor is in the Mess Hall.

00:11:36.362 --> 00:11:38.330
Crewman Jor.

00:11:50.042 --> 00:11:50.974
If this keeps up,

00:11:51.043 --> 00:11:53.307
I may have to open
a special coma ward.

00:11:53.379 --> 00:11:54.812
Take a look at their names.

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:57.508
Tell me if anything strikes you.

00:11:58.718 --> 00:12:00.811
Former Maquis.

00:12:00.886 --> 00:12:02.080
It's either a coincidence,

00:12:02.154 --> 00:12:04.088
or they're being
singled out.

00:12:04.156 --> 00:12:06.090
There hasn't been any hostility
between the Maquis

00:12:06.158 --> 00:12:07.318
and the rest of the crew

00:12:07.393 --> 00:12:08.883
- for years.
- Maybe someone on your crew

00:12:08.961 --> 00:12:11.020
couldn't put the
past behind them.

00:12:11.097 --> 00:12:13.156
"My" crew?

00:12:13.232 --> 00:12:15.291
Our crew.

00:12:15.367 --> 00:12:18.928
Are you any closer
to a diagnosis, Doctor?

00:12:19.071 --> 00:12:20.732
They all have
the same disruptions

00:12:20.806 --> 00:12:22.171
in their synaptic pathways.

00:12:22.241 --> 00:12:25.233
The same cranial
fractures, contusions,

00:12:25.311 --> 00:12:27.905
but I still don't
know the cause,

00:12:27.980 --> 00:12:29.641
or how to reverse it.

00:12:29.715 --> 00:12:30.943
Your investigation?

00:12:31.016 --> 00:12:32.677
Nothing conclusive.

00:12:32.752 --> 00:12:34.686
Five crewmen in comas,

00:12:34.754 --> 00:12:36.119
and we don't have
a single clue?

00:12:36.188 --> 00:12:37.587
The assailant
must have access

00:12:37.656 --> 00:12:38.918
to security protocols.

00:12:38.991 --> 00:12:40.185
There is no other way

00:12:40.259 --> 00:12:41.954
he could've escaped detection.

00:12:42.061 --> 00:12:42.959
Well, you'd better find a way

00:12:43.095 --> 00:12:44.619
to protect the rest
of the Maquis.

00:12:44.697 --> 00:12:46.255
I'm running out of beds.

00:12:48.768 --> 00:12:50.668
What is it you expect us to do?

00:12:50.736 --> 00:12:52.761
Stay alert.

00:12:52.838 --> 00:12:55.238
Report anything suspicious
to Commander Tuvok.

00:12:55.307 --> 00:12:58.105
I'd rather report to you,
if it's all the same.

00:12:58.177 --> 00:12:59.974
He's right.
I've never trusted the Vulcan.

00:13:00.045 --> 00:13:01.342
He's betrayed us before.

00:13:01.413 --> 00:13:03.074
He was doing his job.

00:13:03.149 --> 00:13:04.741
He didn't care
about the Maquis back then.

00:13:04.817 --> 00:13:05.749
Why should he now?

00:13:05.818 --> 00:13:07.046
We're not Maquis anymore.

00:13:07.119 --> 00:13:08.484
Tell that to our friends
in Sick Bay.

00:13:08.554 --> 00:13:09.919
Oh, come on, we put
our differences aside

00:13:09.989 --> 00:13:10.921
seven years ago.

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:12.617
It's ancient history.

00:13:12.691 --> 00:13:14.682
Maybe history
is repeating itself.

00:13:14.760 --> 00:13:16.853
Look, the truth is we don't know
what we're up against,

00:13:16.929 --> 00:13:19.420
but the last thing we need right
now is an outbreak of paranoia.

00:13:19.498 --> 00:13:20.897
Now, until we get
to the bottom of this,

00:13:20.966 --> 00:13:23.867
I want you all
to carry hand phasers.

00:13:23.936 --> 00:13:26.564
Nobody goes anywhere alone.

00:13:26.639 --> 00:13:28.539
We thought maybe the
intruder left behind

00:13:28.607 --> 00:13:29.904
some kind of negative image.

00:13:29.975 --> 00:13:31.272
Displaced photons.

00:13:31.343 --> 00:13:32.605
Tom figured that if we dampen

00:13:32.678 --> 00:13:34.236
the photonic ambiance
and enhance...

00:13:34.313 --> 00:13:36.247
We can applaud
Mr. Paris's ingenuity later.

00:13:36.315 --> 00:13:38.283
What have you found?

00:13:44.557 --> 00:13:46.889
Ensign Tabor.

00:13:46.959 --> 00:13:48.256
Now, take a look at this.

00:13:50.896 --> 00:13:52.261
Impressive.

00:13:52.331 --> 00:13:53.696
It doesn't tell us
who the attacker was,

00:13:53.766 --> 00:13:56.098
but we do know
someone else was here.

00:13:56.168 --> 00:13:57.100
Can you extrapolate

00:13:57.169 --> 00:13:58.602
the assailant's
height and weight?

00:13:58.671 --> 00:14:03.734
I'd say between 170
and 190 centimeters.

00:14:03.809 --> 00:14:05.743
Maybe 75 kilograms.

00:14:05.811 --> 00:14:08.177
That describes about half
the members of the crew.

00:14:08.247 --> 00:14:10.306
At least we can rule out
Naomi Wildman.

00:14:10.382 --> 00:14:11.781
Is it possible to increase

00:14:11.851 --> 00:14:12.909
the resolution?

00:14:12.985 --> 00:14:14.350
We're already working on it.

00:14:15.588 --> 00:14:17.249
Keep me informed.

00:14:25.030 --> 00:14:26.258
Commander?

00:14:34.907 --> 00:14:36.875
Stop it; you're
making me nervous.

00:14:36.942 --> 00:14:38.102
It doesn't make sense.

00:14:38.177 --> 00:14:39.940
This ship,
with all its sensors...

00:14:40.079 --> 00:14:41.910
how could five
people be attacked

00:14:41.981 --> 00:14:43.278
without leaving a trace?

00:14:43.349 --> 00:14:44.611
Good question.

00:14:44.683 --> 00:14:45.945
Maybe it's a conspiracy.

00:14:46.051 --> 00:14:46.949
Ever since Voyager

00:14:47.052 --> 00:14:48.917
began sending
datastreams back home,

00:14:48.988 --> 00:14:49.955
Starfleet has known

00:14:50.055 --> 00:14:52.387
that almost a quarter
of the crew is Maquis.

00:14:52.458 --> 00:14:53.390
So?

00:14:53.459 --> 00:14:55.120
Maybe they think
we're still dangerous.

00:14:55.194 --> 00:14:56.593
Maybe they ordered the Captain

00:14:56.662 --> 00:14:58.493
to neutralize the threat.

00:14:58.564 --> 00:15:00.191
Yes, that's it.

00:15:00.266 --> 00:15:02.166
She's putting us
all into stasis.

00:15:02.234 --> 00:15:04.361
The comas
are just a cover story.

00:15:04.436 --> 00:15:06.870
It would be easier
than putting us all in the brig.

00:15:11.777 --> 00:15:12.903
It could be her.

00:15:13.045 --> 00:15:14.512
Oh, please.

00:15:20.552 --> 00:15:21.814
That'll be all, Crewman.

00:15:21.887 --> 00:15:23.582
Please send in Mr. Kim.

00:15:30.596 --> 00:15:32.826
I'm still trying to enhance
the photon displacement.

00:15:32.898 --> 00:15:34.365
I appreciate your efforts,
Mr. Kim,

00:15:34.433 --> 00:15:36.526
but I called you here
for another reason.

00:15:36.602 --> 00:15:38.365
In the last datastream
from Earth,

00:15:38.437 --> 00:15:41.167
you received a letter
from someone named Dennis Kim.

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:42.730
My cousin.

00:15:42.808 --> 00:15:44.435
In that letter, he spoke

00:15:44.510 --> 00:15:47.138
of your mutual friend,
Maxwell Saroyan.

00:15:47.212 --> 00:15:48.304
You read my mail?

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:50.109
Yes.

00:15:50.182 --> 00:15:52.673
Isn't that a violation
of privacy protocols?

00:15:52.751 --> 00:15:54.480
As the Chief of Security,

00:15:54.553 --> 00:15:56.817
I have the authority
to suspend those protocols

00:15:56.889 --> 00:15:58.447
under special circumstances.

00:15:58.524 --> 00:15:59.582
And what is so special

00:15:59.658 --> 00:16:01.148
about a letter from my cousin?

00:16:01.226 --> 00:16:02.887
The attacks began

00:16:02.995 --> 00:16:05.555
shortly after we received
the last datastream.

00:16:05.631 --> 00:16:07.895
Your letter was part
of that transmission.

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:09.900
A lot of people got letters.

00:16:10.002 --> 00:16:13.665
28, to be exact,
but only six of them matched

00:16:13.739 --> 00:16:17.835
the physical parameters
of the photon displacement.

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:20.208
Am I a suspect?

00:16:20.279 --> 00:16:21.712
According to the letter,

00:16:21.780 --> 00:16:24.248
your friend, Mr. Saroyan,

00:16:24.316 --> 00:16:26.910
was killed by the Maquis
a number of years ago.

00:16:27.052 --> 00:16:30.920
You got me, Tuvok. I confess.

00:16:31.023 --> 00:16:32.923
I was so distraught
after hearing Max's name

00:16:33.025 --> 00:16:35.619
that I fired my Captain
Proton comatizer

00:16:35.694 --> 00:16:37.423
at every Maquis I could find.

00:16:37.496 --> 00:16:40.829
Your sarcasm could be viewed
as subterfuge.

00:16:40.899 --> 00:16:43.459
Tuvok, it's me, Harry.

00:16:43.535 --> 00:16:45.662
Do you really think
I'd be capable of this?

00:16:45.738 --> 00:16:48.206
My personal views
are irrelevant.

00:16:48.273 --> 00:16:51.936
I learned about Max's death
a long time ago.

00:16:52.044 --> 00:16:53.341
I was upset,

00:16:53.412 --> 00:16:54.674
but I don't blame the Maquis,

00:16:54.747 --> 00:16:56.977
and I certainly don't
blame anyone on this ship.

00:16:59.318 --> 00:17:01.286
If that'll be all?

00:17:06.058 --> 00:17:07.548
Is everything all right?

00:17:07.626 --> 00:17:10.754
This investigation is...

00:17:10.829 --> 00:17:13.457
perplexing.

00:17:13.532 --> 00:17:16.023
It defies logic.

00:17:16.101 --> 00:17:20.538
I'll keep you posted
on the holodeck analysis.

00:17:20.606 --> 00:17:21.903
Doctor to Commander Tuvok.

00:17:21.974 --> 00:17:26.138
Report to Sick Bay immediately.

00:17:26.211 --> 00:17:28.645
On my way.

00:17:32.518 --> 00:17:33.542
I thought you might like

00:17:33.619 --> 00:17:35.177
to have a few words
with Mr. Tabor.

00:17:35.254 --> 00:17:36.186
How did you revive him?

00:17:36.255 --> 00:17:37.187
I didn't.

00:17:37.256 --> 00:17:39.747
His synaptic pathways
stabilized on their own.

00:17:39.825 --> 00:17:41.884
How do you feel?

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:44.827
Fine, sir. Hungry.

00:17:44.897 --> 00:17:46.728
What do you remember?

00:17:46.799 --> 00:17:50.599
Not much. I was working
in the holodeck, and...

00:17:50.669 --> 00:17:52.034
then I was here.

00:17:52.104 --> 00:17:54.402
Was anyone in the
holodeck with you?

00:17:54.473 --> 00:17:56.941
No, sir.

00:17:57.042 --> 00:17:59.909
Do you know why anyone
would want to hurt you?

00:17:59.978 --> 00:18:02.208
No.

00:18:02.281 --> 00:18:04.875
What's going on?

00:18:04.983 --> 00:18:07.213
Thank you, Ensign.

00:18:10.589 --> 00:18:11.988
Crewman.

00:18:13.559 --> 00:18:15.891
I remember ordering everyone
to work in pairs.

00:18:15.961 --> 00:18:17.223
Where's your partner?

00:18:17.296 --> 00:18:18.888
Uh, she's, uh, uh...

00:18:18.964 --> 00:18:20.431
Who's your partner?

00:18:20.499 --> 00:18:21.431
Lieutenant Torres.

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:22.762
I told her
we shouldn't split up, sir,

00:18:22.835 --> 00:18:25.269
but she said
she could handle herself.

00:18:25.337 --> 00:18:27.567
You know how stubborn
she can be.

00:18:27.639 --> 00:18:29.106
I have a vague idea.

00:18:29.174 --> 00:18:30.402
Do you know where she went?

00:18:30.476 --> 00:18:32.068
Cargo Bay 2, sir.

00:18:36.849 --> 00:18:38.817
B'Elanna?

00:18:40.552 --> 00:18:44.283
Computer,
locate Lieutenant Torres.

00:18:44.356 --> 00:18:47.018
Lieutenant Torres
is in Cargo Bay 2.

00:19:05.344 --> 00:19:07.073
Help me get her to Sick Bay.

00:19:08.981 --> 00:19:10.676
This is a holy time.

00:19:10.749 --> 00:19:12.410
What?

00:19:14.987 --> 00:19:16.682
Security to Cargo Bay 2!

00:19:22.461 --> 00:19:25.191
Let the mind awaken
and focus on the task.

00:19:25.264 --> 00:19:27.198
My mind to your mind.

00:19:27.266 --> 00:19:29.826
My thoughts
to your thoughts.

00:19:34.339 --> 00:19:35.897
Captain's Log, supplemental.

00:19:36.008 --> 00:19:37.270
Chakotay and B'Elanna

00:19:37.342 --> 00:19:40.903
are the latest victims
of our mysterious assailant.

00:19:41.013 --> 00:19:44.107
I've decided to put the ship
on a level-10 security alert.

00:19:44.183 --> 00:19:47.277
Nonessential personnel
are confined to quarters,

00:19:47.352 --> 00:19:50.810
and security teams have been
posted on all decks.

00:19:52.591 --> 00:19:56.425
Ensign, run
a metallurgical analysis.

00:19:57.996 --> 00:19:59.463
Two more victims regained
consciousness...

00:19:59.531 --> 00:20:00.930
Crewmen Yosa and Jor.

00:20:01.033 --> 00:20:02.864
Their bio-readings
returned to normal

00:20:02.935 --> 00:20:04.027
as if they suffered
nothing worse

00:20:04.102 --> 00:20:05.933
than a good night's sleep.

00:20:06.038 --> 00:20:07.938
Doesn't make any sense.

00:20:08.073 --> 00:20:09.301
It is, however, a pattern,

00:20:09.374 --> 00:20:11.638
and a pattern implies purpose.

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:13.302
We simply have to uncover it.

00:20:13.378 --> 00:20:14.811
- Any clues here?
- Not yet.

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:15.812
I'm beginning to think

00:20:15.881 --> 00:20:17.849
our perpetrator is a ghost.

00:20:17.916 --> 00:20:19.144
Perhaps we should conduct
a seance.

00:20:19.218 --> 00:20:20.947
It couldn't hurt.

00:20:21.053 --> 00:20:23.078
I have worked meticulously,

00:20:23.155 --> 00:20:25.919
yet he has
outwitted me each time.

00:20:25.991 --> 00:20:28.050
How can you be
sure it's a he?

00:20:28.126 --> 00:20:30.686
I can't, but I am.

00:20:30.762 --> 00:20:32.696
Another hunch?

00:20:32.764 --> 00:20:35.130
I can almost sense his presence.

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:38.727
It's as though
he's challenging me to find him.

00:20:40.939 --> 00:20:42.668
I'd say you're
taking this

00:20:42.741 --> 00:20:44.402
a little too personally.

00:20:44.476 --> 00:20:46.501
- Maybe you should take a break.
- No.

00:20:46.578 --> 00:20:47.670
You haven't slept in three days.

00:20:47.746 --> 00:20:50.180
Get some rest, meditate,
clear your mind.

00:20:50.249 --> 00:20:51.341
My mind is perfectly clear.

00:20:51.416 --> 00:20:54.044
I don't want to make this
an order, Tuvok.

00:20:57.089 --> 00:20:58.522
I'll go over your scans.

00:20:58.590 --> 00:21:00.990
Fresh pair of eyes might help.

00:21:01.093 --> 00:21:03.994
Captain.

00:22:29.047 --> 00:22:31.515
Resist your doubts.

00:22:39.124 --> 00:22:42.685
Don't question your mission.

00:22:45.430 --> 00:22:49.958
Filter out
the polarized photons.

00:22:50.068 --> 00:22:51.558
Anyone you know?

00:22:52.637 --> 00:22:53.968
Tuvok...

00:22:54.072 --> 00:22:56.506
Computer, isolate
the precise time index

00:22:56.575 --> 00:22:57.667
of this image.

00:22:57.743 --> 00:23:00.507
Stardate 54090.4.

00:23:00.579 --> 00:23:02.513
Where was Commander Tuvok
at that time?

00:23:02.581 --> 00:23:04.913
Access to that information
has been restricted.

00:23:05.016 --> 00:23:06.278
By whom?

00:23:06.351 --> 00:23:07.909
Access to that information
has been restricted.

00:23:08.053 --> 00:23:09.520
Tuvok, what's going on?

00:23:09.588 --> 00:23:11.283
Computer, override those
security restrictions...

00:23:11.356 --> 00:23:13.620
authorization:
Tuvok-pi-Alpha.

00:23:13.692 --> 00:23:15.250
Restrictions overridden.

00:23:15.327 --> 00:23:17.921
Where was Commander Tuvok
at the specified time?

00:23:18.063 --> 00:23:19.928
Commander Tuvok was
in Holodeck 2.

00:23:19.998 --> 00:23:22.023
Computer, based
on the most recent data,

00:23:22.100 --> 00:23:23.727
can you give me
a better estimation

00:23:23.802 --> 00:23:25.030
of the intruder's height?

00:23:25.103 --> 00:23:27.799
182 centimeters.

00:23:27.873 --> 00:23:31.206
And what is the height
of Lieutenant Commander Tuvok?

00:23:31.276 --> 00:23:33.744
182 centimeters.

00:23:33.812 --> 00:23:36.906
Captain, I believe I...

00:23:36.982 --> 00:23:38.449
Ignore your doubts.

00:23:39.351 --> 00:23:40.511
No.

00:23:40.585 --> 00:23:43.076
Commander, lower your weapon.

00:23:43.155 --> 00:23:45.749
Pagh 'tem 'far B'tanay.

00:23:45.824 --> 00:23:47.348
Who are you?

00:23:53.298 --> 00:23:54.697
Captain, it would appear

00:23:54.766 --> 00:23:58.293
that I am the guilty party.

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.565
How is that possible?

00:24:00.639 --> 00:24:03.767
I don't know...

00:24:03.842 --> 00:24:08.609
but for the safety of the crew,
you must confine me to the brig.

00:24:18.523 --> 00:24:21.822
He wants to speak with you,
but I advise you to remain

00:24:21.893 --> 00:24:23.918
outside the force field.

00:24:23.995 --> 00:24:25.223
Tuvok.

00:24:28.300 --> 00:24:30.325
Can you hear me?

00:24:32.504 --> 00:24:34.529
I hear you...

00:24:34.606 --> 00:24:35.937
but there is another voice

00:24:36.041 --> 00:24:37.941
trying to control me.

00:24:38.043 --> 00:24:40.841
Another voice? Whose?

00:24:43.982 --> 00:24:47.816
"This is... a holy time."

00:24:47.886 --> 00:24:50.081
What did you mean by that?

00:24:50.155 --> 00:24:53.522
A primal energy charges
the blood,

00:24:53.592 --> 00:24:55.116
an energy of rebirth.

00:24:55.193 --> 00:24:57.753
That's what the voice
is telling you?

00:24:57.829 --> 00:25:01.560
It's a Bajoran incantation.

00:25:01.633 --> 00:25:03.897
The voice is Bajoran.

00:25:04.035 --> 00:25:04.899
We need to get

00:25:05.036 --> 00:25:06.230
you to Sick Bay so I can run...

00:25:06.304 --> 00:25:07.271
No!

00:25:08.673 --> 00:25:10.004
No more scans.

00:25:10.075 --> 00:25:11.906
Leave me alone.

00:25:12.010 --> 00:25:13.307
Don't question your mission.

00:25:15.881 --> 00:25:17.348
Get away from me.

00:25:20.685 --> 00:25:22.346
What do you see, Tuvok?

00:25:22.420 --> 00:25:24.149
The Bajoran.

00:25:27.125 --> 00:25:28.683
Ignore him.

00:25:28.760 --> 00:25:30.819
Focus on my voice.

00:25:30.896 --> 00:25:33.694
Tell me what's happening.

00:25:33.765 --> 00:25:36.928
I believe I've...
I've been attacking

00:25:37.002 --> 00:25:40.699
certain members of the crew...
the Maquis...

00:25:40.772 --> 00:25:43.206
then investigating the crimes

00:25:43.275 --> 00:25:46.802
with no memory of what I'd done.

00:25:46.878 --> 00:25:48.607
Attacking them, how?

00:25:48.680 --> 00:25:51.843
Mind-melds.

00:25:51.917 --> 00:25:53.384
Why?

00:25:55.654 --> 00:25:56.985
I don't know.

00:26:00.258 --> 00:26:01.384
He is responsible.

00:26:02.928 --> 00:26:04.225
What did you do to me?!

00:26:04.296 --> 00:26:06.560
Commander...

00:26:06.631 --> 00:26:09.327
Commander!

00:26:09.401 --> 00:26:11.164
Is he a member of the crew?

00:26:13.438 --> 00:26:14.530
Then who is he?

00:26:16.708 --> 00:26:18.073
I don't know.

00:26:20.946 --> 00:26:23.005
The day the first attack
occurred,

00:26:23.081 --> 00:26:25.345
did anything unusual
happen to you?

00:26:28.119 --> 00:26:31.054
I was tending to my duties...

00:26:31.122 --> 00:26:34.489
I received a letter
from my son.

00:26:34.559 --> 00:26:37.619
A letter?

00:26:41.600 --> 00:26:42.862
This all started

00:26:42.934 --> 00:26:45.869
right after we received
the last datastream.

00:26:45.937 --> 00:26:52.501
I reviewed every letter...
except my own.

00:26:52.577 --> 00:26:54.442
Stay with him, Doctor.

00:27:02.988 --> 00:27:04.615
How long?

00:27:04.689 --> 00:27:07.123
29 hours.

00:27:07.192 --> 00:27:09.092
She woke up
just before you did.

00:27:09.160 --> 00:27:11.890
They've all recovered.
We don't know why.

00:27:11.997 --> 00:27:13.259
It's Tuvok.

00:27:13.331 --> 00:27:14.798
Tuvok?

00:27:14.866 --> 00:27:15.798
He's in the brig.

00:27:15.867 --> 00:27:17.232
Apparently,
he's being manipulated

00:27:17.302 --> 00:27:18.769
by some form of mind control.

00:27:18.837 --> 00:27:19.769
Can he leave, Mr. Paris?

00:27:19.838 --> 00:27:21.271
I don't see why not,

00:27:21.339 --> 00:27:23.364
but he should wear
one of these.

00:27:23.441 --> 00:27:25.966
There's something
I want to show you.

00:27:27.512 --> 00:27:30.606
Exolinguistics always seemed
a little too...

00:27:30.682 --> 00:27:31.740
theoretical to me.

00:27:31.816 --> 00:27:35.081
I've decided to study
musical composition instead.

00:27:35.153 --> 00:27:36.916
I would've sent you
my latest construct,

00:27:36.988 --> 00:27:39.752
but they won't give me
enough room in this datastream.

00:27:39.824 --> 00:27:42.554
Maybe next time I can...

00:27:42.627 --> 00:27:44.060
A letter from his son.

00:27:44.129 --> 00:27:46.791
We found another signal embedded
in the message...

00:27:46.865 --> 00:27:49.390
a letter within a letter.

00:27:51.169 --> 00:27:52.227
Hello, Father.

00:27:52.303 --> 00:27:53.930
We received
your last transmission...

00:27:54.005 --> 00:27:57.805
Prophets sing.
This is a holy time.

00:27:57.876 --> 00:28:01.937
B'tanay, the time of awakening.

00:28:02.013 --> 00:28:06.541
Return to that dark place
from which all life springs.

00:28:06.618 --> 00:28:08.176
The signal is calibrated
to correspond

00:28:08.253 --> 00:28:09.880
with Vulcan synaptic
frequencies.

00:28:10.021 --> 00:28:13.184
Tuvok wouldn't have been
consciously aware of it.

00:28:13.258 --> 00:28:15.852
Teero.

00:28:15.927 --> 00:28:17.827
Teero Anaydis.

00:28:17.896 --> 00:28:19.488
He was a Bajoran vedek.

00:28:19.564 --> 00:28:21.122
He worked with the Maquis.

00:28:21.199 --> 00:28:22.461
Doing what?

00:28:22.534 --> 00:28:24.297
Counterintelligence.

00:28:24.369 --> 00:28:25.529
He was thrown out

00:28:25.603 --> 00:28:28.094
for experimenting
with mind control.

00:28:28.173 --> 00:28:31.472
He thought it was a good
way to recruit agents.

00:28:31.543 --> 00:28:33.773
Well, apparently,
he was successful

00:28:33.845 --> 00:28:36.109
at recruiting
our Tactical Officer.

00:28:36.181 --> 00:28:39.275
These incantations and symbols,
they must've triggered something

00:28:39.350 --> 00:28:40.282
in Tuvok...

00:28:40.351 --> 00:28:41.716
preconditioned behavior,

00:28:41.786 --> 00:28:43.879
instructions.

00:28:43.955 --> 00:28:45.752
I should've known
you'd show up again.

00:28:45.824 --> 00:28:47.849
Commander?

00:28:47.926 --> 00:28:49.393
Teero was a fanatic.

00:28:49.461 --> 00:28:52.055
He'd go to any extreme
for the Maquis.

00:28:52.130 --> 00:28:54.325
He called the rest of us
traitors

00:28:54.399 --> 00:28:56.060
for rejecting his ideas.

00:28:56.134 --> 00:28:57.533
Swore he'd fight the war

00:28:57.602 --> 00:28:58.933
on his own if he had to.

00:28:59.070 --> 00:29:01.334
Why instruct Tuvok to mind-meld

00:29:01.406 --> 00:29:05.365
with Voyager's Maquis
35,000 light-years from Earth?

00:29:05.443 --> 00:29:07.775
I'd like Tuvok to take a look
at this message.

00:29:07.846 --> 00:29:10.781
Maybe it'll jog his memory.

00:29:10.849 --> 00:29:12.441
Try to decode those symbols.

00:29:13.685 --> 00:29:15.880
It's him.

00:29:15.954 --> 00:29:18.047
His name is Teero Anaydis.

00:29:18.123 --> 00:29:19.886
Teero?

00:29:20.024 --> 00:29:22.618
He worked
for Maquis Intelligence.

00:29:22.694 --> 00:29:24.787
Yes.

00:29:24.863 --> 00:29:27.627
I remember meeting him.

00:29:27.699 --> 00:29:32.193
I was undercover,
doing reconnaissance

00:29:32.270 --> 00:29:34.500
on a colony near the Badlands.

00:29:34.572 --> 00:29:40.772
He was a vedek at the
Bajoran temple there.

00:29:40.845 --> 00:29:42.540
Go on.

00:29:42.614 --> 00:29:44.912
We spoke briefly.

00:29:45.049 --> 00:29:48.883
He was interested
in Vulcan culture.

00:29:50.722 --> 00:29:53.384
That's all I remember.

00:29:53.458 --> 00:29:55.858
Maybe that's all he wanted you
to remember.

00:29:57.362 --> 00:30:00.456
He was developing some kind
of mind control technique.

00:30:00.532 --> 00:30:05.094
We think he used it on you
seven years ago.

00:30:08.807 --> 00:30:10.399
What is it?

00:30:10.475 --> 00:30:14.434
I-I was restrained.

00:30:14.512 --> 00:30:16.639
Very frightened.

00:30:16.714 --> 00:30:18.705
What did he do to you?

00:30:18.783 --> 00:30:21.115
I can't remember.

00:30:21.186 --> 00:30:23.780
Try.

00:30:23.855 --> 00:30:25.550
I can't!

00:30:27.792 --> 00:30:29.123
Tuvok, if we're
going to help you,

00:30:29.194 --> 00:30:30.491
we need to find out.

00:30:33.431 --> 00:30:35.092
The last time you meditated,

00:30:35.166 --> 00:30:37.191
it helped
the memories resurface,

00:30:37.268 --> 00:30:38.599
didn't it?

00:30:41.039 --> 00:30:43.940
You've helped me meditate.

00:30:44.008 --> 00:30:48.104
I think I've learned a thing
or two about the process.

00:30:48.179 --> 00:30:50.443
Let me try to guide you.

00:31:03.428 --> 00:31:05.419
Where are you?

00:31:05.496 --> 00:31:09.023
In a laboratory... underground.

00:31:09.100 --> 00:31:12.001
Is Teero there?

00:31:14.472 --> 00:31:16.838
There is someone...

00:31:20.345 --> 00:31:22.472
It's him.

00:31:23.681 --> 00:31:27.082
Describe what's happening.

00:31:29.988 --> 00:31:32.047
Lieutenant...

00:31:32.123 --> 00:31:35.490
Tuvok? Tuvok?

00:31:35.560 --> 00:31:38.495
It is Lieutenant,
isn't it?

00:31:38.563 --> 00:31:42.431
I'm sure your Maquis comrades
would be interested to know

00:31:42.500 --> 00:31:44.331
your Starfleet rank.

00:31:44.402 --> 00:31:46.427
Don't worry.

00:31:46.504 --> 00:31:48.665
I don't plan to expose you.

00:31:48.740 --> 00:31:50.435
What do you want?

00:31:51.809 --> 00:31:53.674
You.

00:31:55.046 --> 00:31:57.105
You're the perfect subject.

00:31:57.181 --> 00:31:59.649
For what?

00:31:59.717 --> 00:32:01.844
I'm a student of the mind.

00:32:01.920 --> 00:32:04.445
Yours is remarkable,

00:32:04.522 --> 00:32:05.546
disciplined,

00:32:05.623 --> 00:32:07.022
orderly...

00:32:07.091 --> 00:32:09.423
on the surface, that is.

00:32:09.494 --> 00:32:11.291
Beneath...

00:32:12.730 --> 00:32:14.129
roiling emotions,

00:32:14.198 --> 00:32:16.063
repressed violence.

00:32:16.134 --> 00:32:20.867
In a sense, you're
two different men.

00:32:20.939 --> 00:32:24.033
One I could never
hope to manipulate,

00:32:24.108 --> 00:32:26.076
but the other...

00:32:26.144 --> 00:32:29.944
I have been trained
to resist mind control.

00:32:30.048 --> 00:32:35.111
That's the rational,
logical part of you at work...

00:32:35.186 --> 00:32:38.314
but I want to reach
your inner fire,

00:32:38.389 --> 00:32:40.050
your spirit.

00:32:40.124 --> 00:32:41.216
Why?

00:32:41.292 --> 00:32:42.782
Ple... please...

00:32:42.860 --> 00:32:44.760
please, don't...

00:32:44.829 --> 00:32:47.491
do-don't...

00:32:50.668 --> 00:32:54.126
Pagh 'tem 'far B'tanay.

00:32:56.140 --> 00:32:57.937
Stay away from me!

00:32:58.009 --> 00:32:58.976
Tuvok...

00:32:59.043 --> 00:33:00.635
Complete your mission!

00:33:00.712 --> 00:33:02.179
No!

00:33:02.246 --> 00:33:03.907
This is a holy time.

00:33:03.982 --> 00:33:04.641
Commander...

00:33:10.054 --> 00:33:12.022
Tuvok to Chakotay.

00:33:12.090 --> 00:33:13.352
Go ahead.

00:33:13.424 --> 00:33:17.224
Pagh 'tem 'far B'tanay.

00:33:17.295 --> 00:33:19.729
Understood.

00:33:21.766 --> 00:33:24.200
Janeway to Chakotay.

00:33:25.436 --> 00:33:27.267
Commander?

00:33:31.709 --> 00:33:34.473
Pagh 'tem 'far B'tanay.

00:33:34.545 --> 00:33:36.308
What did that mean, Tuvok?

00:33:36.381 --> 00:33:37.939
Tell me.

00:33:38.082 --> 00:33:39.879
This is a holy time...

00:33:39.951 --> 00:33:42.112
a time of awakening.

00:33:42.186 --> 00:33:45.349
This Teero has awakened you
to do what?

00:33:47.525 --> 00:33:49.959
If you can remember,
you can fight him.

00:33:50.061 --> 00:33:51.323
You can resist.

00:33:51.396 --> 00:33:52.761
What does he want?

00:33:54.899 --> 00:33:56.230
To give us instructions.

00:33:56.300 --> 00:33:57.892
What kind of instructions?

00:33:57.969 --> 00:33:59.869
Focus on your task.

00:33:59.937 --> 00:34:02.269
No.

00:34:11.649 --> 00:34:12.775
It's Chakotay.

00:34:12.850 --> 00:34:13.908
What is it?

00:34:14.018 --> 00:34:15.542
I'm not sure.

00:34:15.620 --> 00:34:19.056
Sick Bay
to Commander Chakotay.

00:34:19.123 --> 00:34:21.353
Computer, locate Chakotay.

00:34:21.426 --> 00:34:23.223
Commander Chakotay
is in Sick Bay.

00:34:23.294 --> 00:34:24.921
Computer, deactivate the EMH.

00:34:26.564 --> 00:34:27.292
Commander?

00:34:32.036 --> 00:34:34.027
Pagh 'tem 'far B'tanay.

00:34:35.773 --> 00:34:37.764
I understand.

00:34:55.626 --> 00:34:57.594
Deck 1.

00:34:59.297 --> 00:35:00.787
Why were you using mind-melds?

00:35:00.865 --> 00:35:02.423
What did Teero want you to do?

00:35:04.168 --> 00:35:06.466
T... to awaken the others.

00:35:07.338 --> 00:35:08.396
Resist your doubts!

00:35:08.473 --> 00:35:10.737
No!

00:35:10.808 --> 00:35:12.742
Focus on me.

00:35:12.810 --> 00:35:13.834
Complete your mission!

00:35:13.911 --> 00:35:15.003
Pagh 'tem 'far

00:35:15.079 --> 00:35:15.875
B'tanay!

00:35:18.182 --> 00:35:20.309
You don't control me!

00:35:21.519 --> 00:35:23.043
Good to see you, Commander.

00:35:23.121 --> 00:35:24.418
It's good to be back.

00:35:34.031 --> 00:35:36.522
Janeway to the Bridge. Report.

00:35:54.519 --> 00:35:56.111
What the hell are you doing?

00:35:56.187 --> 00:35:57.586
I think it's obvious.

00:35:57.655 --> 00:35:59.748
I'm taking control of your ship.

00:35:59.824 --> 00:36:01.086
Within the hour,

00:36:01.159 --> 00:36:02.717
all Starfleet personnel

00:36:02.793 --> 00:36:04.226
will be locked
in their quarters.

00:36:04.295 --> 00:36:05.694
Step back in the brig, Kathryn.

00:36:05.763 --> 00:36:08.061
What's Teero done to you?

00:36:08.132 --> 00:36:09.895
He simply helped us
remember who we are.

00:36:10.001 --> 00:36:11.764
We're Maquis.

00:36:11.836 --> 00:36:13.633
We've always been Maquis.

00:36:13.704 --> 00:36:15.433
The rebellion ended
three years ago.

00:36:15.506 --> 00:36:16.700
You know that.

00:36:16.774 --> 00:36:18.708
In the Alpha Quadrant, maybe.

00:36:18.776 --> 00:36:20.937
Not on this ship.

00:36:24.015 --> 00:36:26.449
Torres to Chakotay.

00:36:26.517 --> 00:36:27.779
Go ahead.

00:36:27.852 --> 00:36:29.285
Deck 11 is secure.

00:36:29.353 --> 00:36:31.321
Acknowledged.

00:36:33.524 --> 00:36:36.550
We're 35,000 light-years
from Earth, Chakotay.

00:36:36.627 --> 00:36:38.356
No one out here even
knows about the Maquis.

00:36:38.429 --> 00:36:39.589
It doesn't make sense.

00:36:39.664 --> 00:36:41.222
There's nothing
you can accomplish.

00:36:41.299 --> 00:36:43.767
As long as we exist,
so does the rebellion.

00:36:43.834 --> 00:36:45.768
That's Teero talking.

00:36:45.836 --> 00:36:46.928
He was unstable.

00:36:47.004 --> 00:36:48.335
You said so yourself.

00:36:48.406 --> 00:36:50.806
We have no intention
of hurting any of you.

00:36:53.244 --> 00:36:55.940
Your orders, Captain?

00:36:56.047 --> 00:36:57.639
Take your station.

00:37:05.389 --> 00:37:08.756
Captain's Log, Stardate 54101.

00:37:08.826 --> 00:37:11.260
Voyager is now
under my command.

00:37:11.329 --> 00:37:13.058
We're en route
to an M-Class planet

00:37:13.130 --> 00:37:17.294
where we'll relocate
the Starfleet crew.

00:37:17.368 --> 00:37:19.563
We're in range.

00:37:19.637 --> 00:37:21.537
On screen.

00:37:22.807 --> 00:37:25.674
Looks like a nice place
for a Federation colony.

00:37:25.743 --> 00:37:27.677
Take us into orbit.

00:37:27.745 --> 00:37:31.476
Tuvok, would you mind
joining me in the ready room?

00:37:38.189 --> 00:37:41.454
You wished to see me, Captain?

00:37:41.525 --> 00:37:43.618
You can drop the formalities.

00:37:43.694 --> 00:37:46.128
This is a Maquis ship now.

00:37:46.197 --> 00:37:48.392
Vulcan brandy.

00:37:48.466 --> 00:37:51.026
I thought we'd have
a drink to celebrate.

00:37:51.102 --> 00:37:52.228
A fitting gesture.

00:37:54.105 --> 00:37:55.197
To awakenings.

00:37:55.273 --> 00:37:56.763
Awakenings.

00:38:02.146 --> 00:38:04.637
There are still 23
of our former comrades

00:38:04.715 --> 00:38:06.114
who aren't with us yet.

00:38:06.183 --> 00:38:09.175
I was hoping you'd be
able to help persuade them.

00:38:09.253 --> 00:38:12.416
I'm prepared to mind-meld
with the remaining Maquis,

00:38:12.490 --> 00:38:16.756
to convey
Teero's instructions.

00:38:16.827 --> 00:38:20.456
It'll be nice to have
my old crew back.

00:38:22.833 --> 00:38:26.599
You've been a big help
to us, Tuvok...

00:38:26.671 --> 00:38:30.402
but I can't forget
what happened seven years ago.

00:38:30.474 --> 00:38:33.739
You have a history
of betraying the Maquis.

00:38:33.811 --> 00:38:36.302
It won't happen again.

00:38:36.380 --> 00:38:37.779
We have a small crew.

00:38:37.848 --> 00:38:40.180
I have to be able
to trust everyone,

00:38:40.251 --> 00:38:42.412
especially my Tactical Officer.

00:38:44.188 --> 00:38:46.315
Bring her in.

00:38:55.700 --> 00:38:59.329
Consider this a test
of your loyalty.

00:38:59.403 --> 00:39:00.563
It's set to kill.

00:39:00.638 --> 00:39:03.664
You said you wouldn't
hurt anyone.

00:39:13.484 --> 00:39:15.577
You're in control
of your actions...

00:39:15.653 --> 00:39:18.781
not Chakotay, not Teero.

00:39:20.591 --> 00:39:22.115
Tuvok?

00:39:23.894 --> 00:39:26.021
Don't do this.

00:39:38.743 --> 00:39:40.540
This phaser is defective.

00:39:43.347 --> 00:39:44.814
Take her back to the brig.

00:39:54.625 --> 00:39:56.855
You pass.

00:40:00.564 --> 00:40:03.158
Now, we've got
some tactical issues to review.

00:40:03.234 --> 00:40:05.464
I want to reroute
all weapons control

00:40:05.536 --> 00:40:07.163
to my command console...

00:40:09.540 --> 00:40:15.740
My mind to your mind.
My thoughts to your thoughts.

00:40:25.022 --> 00:40:26.455
Kim and Paris engineered

00:40:26.524 --> 00:40:28.116
a little breakout on Deck 6.

00:40:28.192 --> 00:40:30.558
We've contained them all
behind a force field.

00:40:30.628 --> 00:40:32.289
We should begin
the evacuation.

00:40:32.363 --> 00:40:33.853
Start beaming them down.

00:40:33.931 --> 00:40:36.957
Begin on Deck 2, Section 01.

00:40:37.101 --> 00:40:38.591
Belay that order.

00:40:38.669 --> 00:40:41.661
Tuvok informed me
that this planet

00:40:41.739 --> 00:40:43.434
has an unstable atmosphere.

00:40:44.475 --> 00:40:45.499
Go to Astrometrics

00:40:45.576 --> 00:40:46.838
and scan for an alternative.

00:40:46.911 --> 00:40:48.173
What are you talking about?

00:40:48.245 --> 00:40:50.236
There's nothing wrong
with the atmosphere.

00:40:50.314 --> 00:40:51.975
We don't have time
to debate this.

00:40:52.082 --> 00:40:55.108
Well, I can scan from here.

00:41:01.125 --> 00:41:05.027
Chakotay, what's going on?

00:41:06.330 --> 00:41:08.093
Stand down.

00:41:12.837 --> 00:41:15.806
Your weapon.

00:41:18.943 --> 00:41:20.638
I thought you might like
your ship back.

00:41:22.546 --> 00:41:25.037
No more rebellion?

00:41:25.115 --> 00:41:28.050
It took another mind-meld
with Tuvok, but I'm fine.

00:41:28.118 --> 00:41:29.449
Tuvok, you're all right?

00:41:29.520 --> 00:41:31.147
I am in control again, Captain.

00:41:31.222 --> 00:41:33.213
Whatever you said
to him, it worked.

00:41:33.290 --> 00:41:36.054
It's good to have you back,
Commander.

00:41:51.842 --> 00:41:54.333
All ready for Attack
of the Lobster People?

00:41:54.411 --> 00:41:56.436
I am not familiar
with that species.

00:41:56.514 --> 00:41:57.947
You will be soon enough.

00:41:58.015 --> 00:42:00.779
I haven't completed
my security rounds.

00:42:00.851 --> 00:42:03.479
You have now.

00:42:06.190 --> 00:42:07.487
Buttered or unbuttered?

00:42:07.558 --> 00:42:10.049
Thank you, Neelix.

00:42:14.331 --> 00:42:17.732
How's right here?

00:42:17.801 --> 00:42:20.133
I saved you a seat.

00:42:20.204 --> 00:42:23.469
How long is this...
entertainment?

00:42:23.541 --> 00:42:24.940
I'm not sure.

00:42:25.042 --> 00:42:28.307
Tom said something
about a "double-feature."

00:42:28.379 --> 00:42:30.643
I've been meaning
to ask you...

00:42:30.714 --> 00:42:34.241
how did you know
that phaser wasn't charged?

00:42:34.318 --> 00:42:35.945
Chakotay doubted my loyalty.

00:42:36.053 --> 00:42:38.647
He wouldn't have given
me an active weapon.

00:42:40.691 --> 00:42:43.387
Not exactly ironclad logic.

00:42:43.460 --> 00:42:46.827
Call it... a hunch.

00:42:46.897 --> 00:42:49.593
Remind me to pay
more attention to your hunches.

00:42:49.667 --> 00:42:50.759
Shh!
